    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9338" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνούτ-ᾰτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unwounded</i> bv stroke of
			sword, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄβλητος καὶ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.4.540
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.75
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>invulnerable,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				16.157
			</span></i>,al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>where no wounds are inflicted,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγωνες</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				37.774
			</span></i>.</div>
